  "items": {
    "lang|tensura_tno|tensura_tno.compat.tensurabarriers.guide.modifier.acceleration": "§bAcceleration§r%1$s: All non-magic damage inside the barrier becomes §cflame§r damage. Each crit you land (§6%2$ss§r cooldown) grants a §6Boost§r, boost give §6+%3$s§r movement speed and §6+%4$s§r projectile speed each lvl, however you lose 1 boost every §6%5$ss§r. Starting from §6Boost %6$s§r you radiate an aura of heat for §6%7$s§r damage every §6%8$ss§r with a radius of §6%9$s§r blocks, increasing by §6+%10$s§r per level. At §6Boost %11$s§r the wall cannot contain the heat and bursts. Trigger a §6%12$s§r block explosion for §6%13$s§r flame damage.",
    "lang|tensura_tno|tensura_tno.compat.tensurabarriers.guide.modifier.family_bond": "§bFamily Bond§r%1$s: Up to §6%2$s§r allies inside split the barrier's upkeep with you. An ally at or below §6%3$s§r of their magicules stops paying and their share returns to you. Players are picked before other entities",
    "lang|tensura_tno|tensura_tno.compat.tensurabarriers.guide.modifier.full_counter": "§bFull Counter§r%1$s: Any projectile that would hit you while inside the barrier is swallowed by the barrier and it's damage is stored. §6%2$ss§r after the first shot is caught, the wall releases everything it holds at §6%3$sx§r the damage, this damage is split evenly among the entities inside.",
    "lang|tensura_tno|tensura_tno.compat.tensurabarriers.guide.modifier.berserker": "§bBerserker§r%1$s: Every EP milestone you have passed (§6%2$s§r of them) adds §6+%3$s§r barrier HP",
    "lang|tensura_tno|tensura_tno.compat.tensurabarriers.guide.modifier.berserk": "§bBerserk§r%1$s: Raises the size limit on barriers by §6%2$sx§r, and every physical hit you or your allies land inside deals §6%3$s§r of its damage again as §cfire§r, and then burning the target for §6%4$ss§r",
    "lang|tensura_tno|tensura_tno.compat.tensurabarriers.guide.modifier.royal_beast": "§bRoyal Beast§r%1$s: Inside, battlewill damage is cut to §6%2$s§r, yours included. While you are transformed battlewills will deal §6%3$s§r damage instead. Magic and elemental damage are nullified",
    "lang|tensura_tno|tensura_tno.compat.tensurabarriers.guide.modifier.survivor": "§bSurvivor§r%1$s: The barrier takes §6%2$s§r less damage, and after §6%3$ss§r of not being hit it heals itself for §6%4$s§r of its maximum HP every second",
    "lang|tensura_tno|tensura_tno.compat.tensurabarriers.guide.modifier.envy": "§bEnvy§r%1$s: Every §6%2$ss§r everything trapped inside loses between §6%3$s§r and §6%4$s§r of its magicules, and they are given to you",
    "lang|tensura_tno|tensura_tno.compat.tensurabarriers.guide.modifier.pride": "§bPride§r%1$s: Any ability cast inside has a §6%2$s§r chance of being copied into §5Pride§r once every §6%3$ss§r This doesn't work on uniques or ultimates",
    "lang|tensura_tno|tensura_tno.compat.tensurabarriers.guide.modifier.traveler": "§bTraveler§r%1$s: The barrier travels with you when you warp, teleporting everyone inside along with it",
    "lang|tensura_tno|tensura_tno.compat.tensurabarriers.guide.modifier.oppression": "§bOppression§r%1$s: There is a §6%2$s§r /level to inflict Oppression for §6%3$ss§r, rolled every §6%4$ss§r",
    "lang|tensura_tno|tensura_tno.compat.tensurabarriers.guide.modifier.anti_skill": "§bAnti-Skill§r%1$s: Seals skills, caster is affected",
    "lang|tensura_tno|tensura_tno.compat.tensurabarriers.guide.modifier.anti_magic": "§bAnti-Magic§r%1$s: Seals magic, caster is affected",
    "lang|tensura_tno|tensura_tno.compat.tensurabarriers.guide.modifier.domain": "§bDomain§r: §6+%1$s§r chant speed, projectiles auto track the nearest enemy, and enemies inside are stripped of barriers",
    "lang|tensura_tno|tensura_tno.compat.tensurabarriers.guide.modifier.veil": "§bVeil§r: Everyone inside is wrapped in Presence Concealment and the barrier turns invisible. How well it hides depends on your veiling skill (§bHaze§r/§bFalsifier§r hide less than §bMurderer§r's)",
